            "created_at": "2025-09-11T20:27:34.619776+00:00",
            "notes": "Round two I typically am around 13-18k I will often purchase  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) and  [Skyline Nanites](item_0b334927-da04-42d6-8dfd-96e7b6c1cd51) if they have a mercy that is doing well, or  [Overcharged Ordnance](item_f261877b-39e5-4248-aeca-7fe34de8ce10) \n\nIf they have some hit scan that can aim I will make sure I have  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)\n\nIf you have a really strong first round getting  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) will enable you to pump out additional damage.\n\nIf you have a weak first round I recommend getting what you can  focusing on  [Overcharged Ordnance](item_f261877b-39e5-4248-aeca-7fe34de8ce10)",
