        {
            "id": "a36679dc-70a2-4753-bdf4-de73494f9db0",
            "build_id": "cf7503c2-3ef7-46e8-90fc-b18151572c83",
            "round_number": 3,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-11T20:27:34.619776+00:00",
            "notes": "You can go either  [Evasive Maneuvers](item_3725ca88-f12a-4a00-8878-4fa39a18a394)  or  [Extra Charge](item_a5aa16ee-5a80-4e1b-b585-2c4d12575b7a) it depends on your ability to get value. \nWhatever you don't get get it in round 5.\n\nBy now you should have your core damage up and the slow from  [Helix Inhibitor](item_0cdf922e-b43f-4b8f-bf2b-0127d1ed2f7d) is a core need.\n\nIf you are getting shot out of the sky play better, or get defense based upon what is happening, where the damage is coming from. \n  [Skyline Nanites](item_0b334927-da04-42d6-8dfd-96e7b6c1cd51)  is also great if you have extra charge as it will proc this damage from the vertical boop.\n\n\nI have recently started to go  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) at a recommendation of another Pharah player I encountered, I do feel if they can't shoot you  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) and  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) limit your immediate burst potential.\n\nAdditional Detail: If you have a  [Winston](hero_a0ebe5ef-69a6-4a8f-9360-7b7fed8bce88) go  [Blitz Barrage](item_b6bd0c8f-9bd2-4d3d-a353-1e70f74e131b)  and right click delete him.",
